 "specialRules": {
  "forms": "Ser Ubar can use both of his forms - Human and Ape. Effects preceded with 'Human:' or 'Ape:' trigger only when you're in the corresponding form. At the Start of an Expedition and during Rest, you may choose which form to use. You start the Clash depending on the form you were in during the Delve. Shapeshift: Swap your current form.",
  "note": "[해석, 확인 필요] Rogue's Path: Clash의 첫 턴 시작에 형태를 선택."
 },
